X:11
T:Drive the Cold Winter Away
T:aka All Hail to the Days or The Praise of Christmas
M:6/4
S:A. H. Bullen, A Christmas Garland (London: John C. Nimmo, 1885)
O:17th Century
K:Em
E2|:"Em"G3F E2 "G"B4 e2|"D"d3cB2"Em"g4G2|"Am7"A4B2"C" c3dc2|1 "B"B6-B2 z2 E2:|2 "B"B6-B2 z2 e2|
"G"d3cB2 "Bm7"d4d2|"Am7"c3BA2 "D"c4c2|"G"B3AG2 "D"F4E2|"Em"g6-g2 z2 e2|
